### Capture a webhook — JSON body with correlation header
POST {{baseUrl}}/kapture/watering
Content-Type: application/json
X-Kapture-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "zone": 1,
  "amount": 42,
  "event": "watering.completed"
}

### Capture a webhook — plain text body
POST {{baseUrl}}/kapture/events/plain
Content-Type: text/plain
X-Kapture-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

plain text payload from a worker

### Capture a GET request with query params
GET {{baseUrl}}/kapture/watering?zone=2&source=manual
X-Kapture-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### Capture a request WITHOUT a correlation header
POST {{baseUrl}}/kapture/no-correlation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "this request has no correlation id"
}
